From: PowerTune <powertune@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: compulab: release USB hub and VBUS resets

Experimentally leave the USB hub reset and USB2 VBUS reset deasserted at
probe on IOT-GATE-iMX8PLUS. Neither reset provider has a DTS consumer to
release it after probe. Device1 hardware validation is still required.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [PowerTune experiment pending hardware validation]
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/compulab/sb-iotgimx8plus.dtsi | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/compulab/sb-iotgimx8plus.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/compulab/sb-iotgimx8plus.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/compulab/sb-iotgimx8plus.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/compulab/sb-iotgimx8plus.dtsi
@@ -23,7 +23,6 @@
 		pinctrl-0 = <&pinctrl_usb_hub_reset>;
 		reset-gpios = <&gpio2 10 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
 		#reset-cells = <0>;
-		initially-in-reset;
 	};
 
 	usb2_vbus_en: usb2-vbus-en {
@@ -32,7 +31,6 @@
 		pinctrl-0 = <&pinctrl_usb2_vbus_en>;
 		reset-gpios = <&gpio4 20 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
 		#reset-cells = <0>;
-		initially-in-reset;
 	};
 
 	user-leds {
